Responsibilities
The Office Intelligence team aims to deliver advanced product solutions in the Corporate Service Management domain for better management efficiency and user experience of staff services. We build intelligent decision-making platforms for business owners and build efficient & comfortable office lifestyles for employees. We also encourage creative ideas and lots of innovative products are grown from our daily work.
Job Responsibilities
- Responsible for the server-side project development of ByteDance's enterprise solution products, delivering highly available, high-performance, and highly scalable business products through high-quality design and coding;
- Responsible for participating in the construction of backend infrastructure, undertaking work related to new technology research and tackling difficult technical problems;
- Responsible for exploring tools and processes to improve team efficiency, deeply involved in the team's technical construction, and enhancing the team's technical atmosphere;
- Continuously contribute at all stages of the product delivery cycle, including but not limited to requirement communication/ system design/ testing communication and support/ monitoring and operation of online systems/ project management, etc.
Qualifications
Minimum Qualifications:
- Bachelor's degree or above, a major in computer science or related fields is preferred.
- Familiar with Java or Golang related technology stack; familiar with JVM / Golang pprof related tuning methods, can quickly locate service problems;
- Familiar with distributed system design patterns, and skilled in using message queues, distributed storage, cache, lock, and other technologies to build efficient, robust systems;
- Familiar with operating systems, computer networks, information security, and capable of using common data structures and algorithms to solve problems;
- Familiar with MySQL and mainstream NoSQL databases, with related usage and optimization experiences, able to analyze and solve related problems independently;
- Familiar with at least one scripting language, able to independently troubleshoot / solve problems on Linux;
- Strong self-learning ability, follows the progression of server-side technologies, continuously updating professional skills;
- Good execution, strong sense of responsibility, excellent communication and collaboration skills, capable of leading the development of medium and large projects.
- Proficiency in English is a must.
Preferred Qualifications:
- Familiarity with AI / ML and being able to apply them to business domain.
About Us
Founded in 2012, ByteDance's mission is to inspire creativity and enrich life. With a suite of more than a dozen products, including TikTok, Lemon8, CapCut and Pico as well as platforms specific to the China market, including Toutiao, Douyin, and Xigua, ByteDance has made it easier and more fun for people to connect with, consume, and create content.​
Why Join ByteDance
Inspiring creativity is at the core of ByteDance's mission. Our innovative products are built to help people authentically express themselves, discover and connect – and our global, diverse teams make that possible. Together, we create value for our communities, inspire creativity and enrich life - a mission we work towards every day.​
As ByteDancers, we strive to do great things with great people. We lead with curiosity, humility, and a desire to make impact in a rapidly growing tech company. By constantly iterating and fostering an "Always Day 1" mindset, we achieve meaningful breakthroughs for ourselves, our Company, and our users. When we create and grow together, the possibilities are limitless. Join us.​
Diversity & Inclusion​
ByteDance is committed to creating an inclusive space where employees are valued for their skills, experiences, and unique perspectives. Our platform connects people from across the globe and so does our workplace. At ByteDance, our mission is to inspire creativity and enrich life. To achieve that goal, we are committed to celebrating our diverse voices and to creating an environment that reflects the many communities we reach. We are passionate about this and hope you are too.​
